ASN.description:
Autonomous system number of the measured client network, as allocated in
the public routing registry. 0 means the aggregate is not keyed by ASN;
AS 0 is reserved and is never a real measurement key.

VALUES.description:
Inline samples, GRID.NLAT * GRID.NLON float32 cells in row-major order;
NaN marks a missing cell. Present only when VALUES_ENCODING is
InlineFloat32 and the cell count is at most 1,048,576.

PLGFlowEdgeContract.description:
Exact validated SDS and representation contract bound into a signed flow
edge. CANONICAL_TYPE and ALIGNED_TYPE describe the same logical schema;
ALIGNED_TYPE carries its fixed layout in TAB.FlatBufferTypeRef.

LANGUAGE.description:
Language of the transmission. A BCP 47 tag when the source publishes one;
otherwise the source's own language term verbatim, never translated and
never guessed from the target area.

